WEBVTT

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:30.910
want die sleutel waarna
hy soek is dié een

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:32.540
en in plaas daarvan doen hy ...

00:10:32.540 --> 00:10:35.200
Nou, ons noem dit misleidende intonasie,

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:36.260
want dit mislei ons.

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:38.890
Ek sê altyd vir my studente:
"By misleidende intonasie,

00:10:38.890 --> 00:10:41.840
lig julle wenkbroue, dan weet almal."

00:10:41.840 --> 00:10:43.000
(Gelag)

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:46.000
(Applous)

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:47.586
Goed.

00:10:48.306 --> 00:10:50.543
Hy kom by E uit, maar
dis die verkeerde sleutel.

00:10:50.543 --> 00:10:51.888
Hy probeer E weer.

00:10:51.888 --> 00:10:53.224
Daai sleutel werk nie.

00:10:53.224 --> 00:10:55.560
Nou probeer hy die E weer.
Die sleutel werk nie.

00:10:55.560 --> 00:10:58.090
Nou probeer hy E weer,
en dit werk nie.

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.910
En dan, uiteindelik ...